# Comma-separated institutional wallets allowed to represent civic authorities.
# The public UI can use these addresses to distinguish authority actions from
# untrusted records carrying the same public attributes.
# Comma-separated Tiramisu wallets allowed to publish trusted authority actions
# and encryption public keys. Never put private keys here.
SADAKSETU_AUTHORITY_OWNERS=0xREPLACE_WITH_AUTHORITY_WALLET
